# Sync parity canvases after each update

When implementing or completing agent-parity / Desktop alignment work in this repo:

1. **Update existing canvases** (do not create parallel duplicates):
   - `~/.cursor/projects/Users-taoma-Documents-grok-build/canvases/agent-parity-roadmap.canvas.tsx`
   - `~/.cursor/projects/Users-taoma-Documents-grok-build/canvases/agent-gap-review.canvas.tsx`
2. Refresh **scores**, **landed checklist**, **wave status**, **NEXT priorities**, and a short **「本轮变更」** callout describing what just changed.
3. Open the roadmap canvas via `open_resource` when the update is done so the user can see it beside chat.
4. Keep honesty: MVP / partial vs done; never claim Chromium, full AST, or per-worker ACP cancel if not shipped.
